As is common in the universal AI literature, AIQI faces the grain of truth (self-referential) problem [Kalai and Lehrer, 1993, leike2016formal, meulemans2025embedded].
Roughly speaking, every mixture return-predictor 
                                  
                                    
                                      
                                      ψ
                                      n
                                    
                                  
                                 in 
                                  
                                    ψ
                                  
                                 has to contain in its class the true conditional return distribution under the AIQI policy 
                                  
                                    
                                      
                                      
                                        ^
                                        π
                                      
                                      ψ
                                    
                                  
                                , which itself depends on 
                                  
                                    ψ
                                  
                                .
The formal statement is given below.

                                  
